ularly as it navigates the diverse linguistic and cultural landscapes of a bilingual nation. The CBC was created from the recommendations of the Aird Commission, which aimed to ensure that Canadian voices and stories were represented in the media landscape dominated by foreign influences, particularly from the United States.

